title: DraculaDoor
---
    -> Open Door
     <<jump FinalJudgement>>
    -> Listen
        <<jump ListenToDracula>>
===

title: ListenToDracula
---
Behind the door you can hear muffled voices and a distant sound of a piano being played.
Near the door someone speaks.
???: I fancy how everything is decorated in roses.
===

title: FinalJudgement
---
<<change_room Ballroom>>
The corridor door opens into a ballroom full of guests and in the center Dracula awaits.
<<dracula_test>>
===

title: StudyDoor
---
    -> Open Door
        <<shadow_milk>>
    -> Listen
        <<jump AngryShadowMilk>>
===

title: AngryShadowMilk
---
Behind this door seems to be quiet...
Occasionally you can hear mumbling.
Relyn Valtien: It's a mess here, where are those good for nothing servants when you need them!?
===

title: ShadowMilkKick
---
Relyn Valtien: Who are you? Get out now!
<<change_room Corridor>>
===

title: Presents
---
In the present boxes, you find various pieces of clothing. 
You take them. 
===

title: Guard
---
Before this particular door stands an menacing guard. 
    -> Go to the room.
        <<guard_test>>
    -> Ask why the guard is standing there.
        <<jump GuardAsk>>
===

title: GuardAsk
---
Guard: Only the lady shall pass.
===

title: Staked
---
You try to enter the room regardless of the menacing guard standing before you. 
As you tries to pass, the guard pulls out a wooden stake and drives it through your heart. 
Unfortunately for you, you are not a vampire, who would go into an unconscious state,
No, you are a human and die instantly from the attack.
<<title_screen>>
===

title: Lady
---
Guard: My Lady.
<<change_room Ladyroom>>
===

